WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Chris and Kuru Kahui were twins, ages three months old when they died in hospital, both suffering from traumatic brain injury. Their death was a result of severe impact, either from direct blows or being hit, thrown or slammed against a hard surface. Violent shaking was another possible cause and couldn't be ruled out. What was clear was that the twins' injuries weren't accidental. Their death was a result of somebody using deliberate force against them. It was determined the injuries were most likely inflicted at the same time by the same person.
克里斯和库鲁·卡胡伊是一对双胞胎，在医院去世时年仅三个月，两人都遭受了创伤性脑损伤。他们的死是由于受到严重撞击，无论是直接击打、被殴打、被扔向或猛撞到硬物表面造成的。剧烈摇晃是另一个可能的原因，也不能被排除。显而易见的是，这对双胞胎的受伤并非意外。他们的死是有人对他们蓄意施暴造成的。经判定，这些伤势极有可能是由同一个人在同一时间造成的。

2
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:35.000
